CM_ SG_ 359 FobSearchResult "   7         6       5       4         3              2                 1                 0
|Status|Status|Fault|Trunk|Interior|ExteriorRight|ExteriorLeft|ExteriorRear|

Status is 2 bits encoded as:
  7     6
  0     0   = NO_ACTION
  0     1   = IN_PROGRESS
  1     0   = COMPLETE
  1     1   = TIMEOUT

Fault: 0 = NO_FAULT, 1 = FAULT

Trunk, Interior, ExteriorRight, ExteriorLeft, ExteriorRear: 
0 = NO_FOB_IN_ZONE, 1 = FOB_IN_ZONE";
