CM_ SG_ 1376 BCANAutoStopFailSts "This signal indicates if is present a faillure on BCAN Nodes that compromises S&S functionality
Bit 0 - NCLAutoStopFailSts
Bit 1 - NQSAutoStopFailSts 
Bit 2 - NCPAutoStopFailSts
Bit 3 - NBCAutoStopFailSts
Bits? Values: 
0 = Fail Not present
1 = Fail Present
0 = Startup / Default
The bits can be transmitted simultaneously.";
